function registrationPanel(s,compact=false){const country=activeVenture(s)?.country||s.costPlan.country||"Liberia",j=JURISDICTIONS[country]||JURISDICTIONS.Liberia;return `<div>${compact?"":pageTitle("Guided tracker","Business Registration","Preparation and status tracking only. The platform does not submit to government portals in this prototype.")}<section class="panel panel-pad"><div class="workspace-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">${esc(country)} · ${j.code}</div><h2>Guidance only</h2><p>${esc(j.authority)}. Official portal and connected API modes remain disabled pending source review and credentials.</p></div>${status("Research required")}</div><div class="registration-modes"><div class="active"><strong>Guidance only</strong><span>Available</span></div><div><strong>Official portal link</strong><span>Not reviewed</span></div><div><strong>Connected API</strong><span>Disabled</span></div></div><div class="requirement-grid">${["Recommended entity types","Eligibility","Ownership constraints","Required documents","Registration steps","Responsible authority","Estimated official cost","Processing time","Tax registration","Local permits","Employer requirements","Renewal obligations"].map(x=>`<div><strong>${x}</strong><span>${x.includes("cost")?"Official cost not yet verified":"Information requested"}</span></div>`).join("")}</div>${button("Create private registration case","enterprise-registration-case","primary")}</section><div class="legal-guidance">Guidance only. A human reviewer must confirm legal setup readiness; no government submission occurs here.</div></div>`;}
